<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 494 0 R
/T (Tickets is the central transactional form. Users, Support Agents and Categories hold master data that changes rarely, and each ticket refers to them through lookup fields, so a person, an agent or a category is stored once and reused. One ticket can have many comments, and each comment refers to its ticket. No subforms are used. Assigned_Agent is optional so that a new ticket can exist before it is assigned. )
/E (Tickets is the central transactional form. Users, Support Agents and Categories hold master data that changes rarely, and each ticket refers to them through lookup fields, so a person, an agent or a category is stored once and reused. One ticket can have many comments, and each comment refers to its ticket. No subforms are used. Assigned_Agent is optional so that a new ticket can exist before it is assigned. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
