1561 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 502 0 R
/E (Categories and Tickets forms. The Categories form holds the issue categories Hardware, Software, Network, Account / Login, Email, Printer and Other. The Tickets form is the central form: it stores the title, description, category, priority, status, assigned agent, attachment, creator, creation date and resolution date. New tickets default to the status Open and the current date, so a request is never saved without a status. The scripts DS-01 and DS-02 are attached to this form \(Section 5.5\). )
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1562 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 502 0 R
/E (Ticket Comments form. The Ticket Comments form stores a comment, the ticket it belongs to, the commenter and the comment date. Because comments are separate records, the full conversation of a ticket can be listed in date order, and the script DS- 03 checks the status of the related ticket before a comment is accepted. )
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
