2236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 521 0 R
/T (The constraints met on Zoho Creator were mostly related to the platform's boundaries. The user-interface options of pages and reports are limited to the components provided by the UI Builder, so a fully custom design would need a pro-code widget. Deluge has limits on the number of statements and API calls, which are not reached in this small application. Some features depend on the edition and plan: the number of users, the availability of environments and the integrations differ between the Education, Standard and Professional editions. )
/E (The constraints met on Zoho Creator were mostly related to the platform's boundaries. The user-interface options of pages and reports are limited to the components provided by the UI Builder, so a fully custom design would need a pro-code widget. Deluge has limits on the number of statements and API calls, which are not reached in this small application. Some features depend on the edition and plan: the number of users, the availability of environments and the integrations differ between the Education, Standard and Professional editions. )
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
2237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 521 0 R
/T (On the spectrum from no-code to pro-code, most of this application is no-code configuration: the five forms, field types, lookups, the list reports, the dashboard page, the role permissions and the attachment field were created by configuration in the builder, without Zia AI assistant as a development aid. Low-code Deluge was needed for the three short scripts that validate dates, stamp the resolution date and check comments. )
/E (On the spectrum from no-code to pro-code, most of this application is no-code configuration: the five forms, field types, lookups, the list reports, the dashboard page, the role permissions and the attachment field were created by configuration in the builder, without Zia AI assistant as a development aid. Low-code Deluge was needed for the three short scripts that validate dates, stamp the resolution date and check comments. )
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
