5027 0 obj
<<
/Title (On the spectrum from no-code to pro-code, most of this application is no-code configuration: the five forms, field types, lookups, the list reports, the dashboard page, the role permissions and the attachment field were created by configuration in the builder, without Zia AI assistant as a development aid. Low-code Deluge was needed for the three short scripts that validate dates, stamp the resolution date and check comments.)
/Dest [62 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5021 0 R
>>
endobj
