5032 0 obj
<<
/Title (The constraints met on Zoho Creator were mostly related to the platform's boundaries. The user-interface options of pages and reports are limited to the components provided by the UI Builder, so a fully custom design would need a pro-code widget. Deluge has limits on the number of statements and API calls, which are not reached in this small application. Some features depend on the edition and plan: the number of users, the availability of environments and the integrations differ between the Education, Standard and Professional editions.)
/Dest [62 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5026 0 R
>>
endobj
