5409 0 obj
<<
/Title (Tickets is the central transactional form. Users, Support Agents and Categories hold master data that changes rarely, and each ticket refers to them through lookup fields, so a person, an agent or a category is stored once and reused. One ticket can have many comments, and each comment refers to its ticket. No subforms are used. Assigned_Agent is optional so that a new ticket can exist before it is assigned.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5407 0 R
>>
endobj
