5418 0 obj
<<
/Title (fields, default values, drop-down choices, lookups and the success message. Script testing checks DS-01, DS-02 and DS-03 with valid and invalid inputs. Integration testing checks the relationships between forms \(a ticket refers to a category and an agent, a comment refers to a ticket\) and the attachment upload. Role-based access testing is performed by signing in as an Admin, a Support Agent and a User to confirm that each sees only the permitted records and operations.)
/Dest [52 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5412 0 R
/Prev 5417 0 R
>>
