/Title (The only integration used by the application is the built-in file upload, which keeps a screenshot with the ticket it explains. No external REST API was required for the core application, therefore no invokeurl script, webhook or Postman test is included. E-mail notification, Zoho Analytics and other integrations are future enhancements and are described in Section 9.2.)
/Dest [48 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5520 0 R
/Prev 5544 0 R
>>
