<<
/Title (The portal has four groups of menus. The Home page is a dashboard with KPI tiles and charts. The User section contains Submit Ticket, My Tickets and Add Comment. The Agent section contains Assigned Tickets, Update Status and Add Comment. The Admin section contains Manage Users, Manage Agents, Manage Categories, Manage Tickets, Manage Comments and Reports. Sections are shown to a user according to the role assigned to that user, wherever the platform supports it.)
/Dest [39 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5531 0 R
