/Title (All three workflows are form workflows, because the automation is triggered by saving a record. The ticket status is changed by the support agent and no approval process is used. A scheduled workflow \(for example, a reminder for tickets that stay Open\), an approval process and a Blueprint that enforces the order of the statuses were considered unnecessary for the first version and are listed as future enhancements.)
/Dest [47 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5547 0 R
